msgstr "جولة"

#: blocks/booking/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "reservation"
msgstr "حجز مسبق"

#: blocks/from-price/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "From price"
msgstr "السعر ابتداءً من"

#: blocks/from-price/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The tour’s “From” price with its basis, or “Price on request”. Leave the "
"tour empty to use the tour being viewed."
msgstr ""
"سعر الجولة «ابتداءً من» مع أساسه، أو «السعر عند الطلب». اترك الجولة فارغة "
"لاستخدام الجولة المعروضة."

#: blocks/from-price/block.json blocks/price-table/block.json
#: blocks/tour-facts/block.json blocks/tour-list/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
