#: blocks/tour-facts/block.json blocks/tour-list/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "digitum"
msgstr "digitum"

#: blocks/price-table/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Price table"
msgstr "جدول الأسعار"

#: blocks/price-table/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Every option of the tour with its duration and price. Leave the tour empty "
"to use the tour being viewed."
msgstr ""
"كل خيار في الجولة مع مدته وسعره. اترك الجولة فارغة لاستخدام الجولة المعروضة."

#: blocks/tour-facts/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Tour facts"
msgstr "معلومات الجولة"

#: blocks/tour-facts/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Key facts: duration, price basis, group size, age, licence, pickup, meeting "
"point and sessions. Leave the tour empty to use the tour being viewed."
msgstr ""
"المعلومات الأساسية: المدة وأساس السعر وحجم المجموعة والعمر والرخصة والتوصيل "
"ونقطة الالتقاء والفترات. اترك الجولة فارغة لاستخدام الجولة المعروضة."

#: blocks/tour-list/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Tour list"
msgstr "قائمة الجولة"

#: blocks/tour-list/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"What is included, not included, or the requirements of the tour. Leave the "
"tour empty to use the tour being viewed."
msgstr ""
"ما هو مشمول وغير مشمول، أو متطلبات الجولة. اترك الجولة فارغة لاستخدام الجولة"
" المعروضة."
